:name: SentAI B8.8 P1 USB host probe smoke
:description: Boot the USB-host-stack probe target.  This runs the production `libs/usb/usb_host_task.cc` constructor (CLOCK_EnableUsbhs1*, USB_EhciLowPowerPhyInit, USB_HostInit) against whatever the current `sentai_rt1176.repl` provides for USB OTG2 / USBPHY1 / CCM (currently flipflop stubs).  Expected: the probe hits the first MMIO read that returns a value the NXP driver rejects.  The Renode log + uart.log + sentai_emu_boot_state combined identify P2's work list.

i @emu/renode/sentai_rt1176.repl

$bin?=@build_emu/emu/sentai_emu_usbhost_probe
$uart_log?=@/home/bogdan/work/coralmicro/emu/output/sentai_emu_usbhost_probe.log

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
    cpu VectorTableOffset 0x800
"""

lpuart6 CreateFileBackend $uart_log
runMacro $reset

emulation RunFor "3s"

lpuart6 CloseFileBackend $uart_log

echo "sentai_emu_usbhost_probe PC:"
cpu PC
echo "sentai_emu_usbhost_probe boot_state:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord `sysbus GetSymbolAddress "g_sentai_emu_boot_state"`
echo "sentai_emu_usbhost_probe step:"
sysbus ReadDoubleWord `sysbus GetSymbolAddress "g_sentai_emu_step"`
